; Osdrop's own installer messages (English). Inno Setup reads .isl files as UTF-8 only with a BOM.

[CustomMessages]
ServiceSetupFailed=The Osdrop Input service could not be installed (error %1). Until it is, this PC's mouse and keyboard cannot cross to the other computers and they cannot control this PC: run this installer again, or press Repair in Osdrop's panel.
FirewallSetupFailed=The firewall rule for Osdrop could not be added (error %1). Windows may ask whether Osdrop may use the network when it first starts.
